OL,3,ATwo major Kyiv bridges hit in Russian
OL,4,Aattack, mayor says
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo major bridges in the Ukrainian
OL,7,Fcapital have reportedly been struck in
OL,8,Fa Russian ballistic missile attack,
OL,9,FKyiv Mayor Vitali Klitschko said.
OL,11,FThe missiles hit Kyiv's Northern and
OL,12,FSouthern bridges spanning the Dnipro
OL,13,FRiver, Klitschko said, adding that
OL,14,Fwater and power supplies in the city
OL,15,Fhad been disrupted.
OL,17,FMeanwhile, Ukraine struck the landmark
OL,18,FKerch Bridge connecting Russia to
OL,19,Foccupied Crimea for a second
OL,20,Fconsecutive day, the region's
OL,21,FMoscow-installed governor said.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
