OL,3,ATwo major Kyiv bridges hit in Russian
OL,4,Aattack, mayor says
OL,5,
OL,6,FPresident Volodymyr Zelensky had
OL,7,Fearlier warned that Moscow might launch
OL,8,Ffurther strikes on the country on
OL,9,FMonday night, after Ukrainian, US and
OL,10,FEuropean officials held further talks
OL,11,Faimed at ending the years-long
OL,12,Fconflict.
